# Eat the fish, spit the bones

Full catalogue: `docs/EAT-FISH-SPIT-BONES.md` (Claudegres Index Scan lie, Multigres checklists, Shamiri C11/B-05 scars).

Models/agents are **drafts**, not oracles. Keep only what matches independent observation.

## Non-negotiable

1. Never grade a claim by narrative alone. Require HTTP status/body, Turso before→after, R2 object, log/trace, test exit, or a file opened this turn.
2. Every verify reply uses **Fish / Bones / Unknown**.
3. Plans are not proof. Claudegres: `EXPLAIN Index Scan` while FileRead was sequential. Same class: UI “saved” with no `PresenceAudits`/`VoiceNotes` row.
4. Wrong harness ≠ working feature. Client-supplied IG URL ≠ owned media. Hardcoded PASS/FAIL ≠ probe.
5. Do not invent evidence. Unrun checks = Unknown or code-only.
6. Never invent Gabber-style uplift percentages (“69% chance of 4x”).
7. Do not promote Bones into `docs/STAGES.md`.

## Shwaah Fish vs Bones (feature-specific)

| Fish | Bones |
|------|--------|
| Audit 201 + `PresenceAudits` row + grades in body | Mock grades / empty table / foreign media accepted |
| Unlock 402 without credits; 200 + persisted `fix` with credits | “Fix unlocked” toast with null `fix` |
| Voice note 201 + Turso row + playable `audioUrl` | Recorder UI only; no R2 object |
| Direction 201 + five ideas + history GET | Pretty prose, no `DirectionSessions` row |
| Build/lint for **touched** paths | “Build passed” as proof the endpoint works |

## When stuck

Re-run the real route. Log path (endpoint, status, SQL/R2). Fix the probe before trusting the score. Read `docs/EAT-FISH-SPIT-BONES.md`.
